  "review_notes": [
    "Supported Hardware pending106 quick-check explicitly asks readers to confirm AMD listing separately and already qualifies AVX for x86_64. These two final row corrections make its remaining table match that accepted guidance.",
    "Verification Stages row is bounded to x86_64 and explicitly leaves ARM64 clarification. It does not promise ARM64 eligibility or test-image execution.",
    "Host Teams table retains its already supported billing_read and billing_write rows. The new lead-in and payout row distinguish those documented controls from the unconfirmed payout-role matrix. All five related earnings/destination claims are narrowed together across Host Teams and Host Payouts.",
    "Tax Guide retains the current sourced provider/general-jurisdiction advice and section headings. Four conservative instructions directly replace the four unsupported practice assertions. They add no tax rates, withholding rule, universal form duty, VAT exemption, secure upload guarantee or claim that tax fields were actually rendered.",
    "The Tax Guide deletion/navigation/redirect decision remains a distinct optional action; no extra adjacent or navigation edit is needed to make these four replacements coherent."
  ],
